# Case: Incremental history browsing
# Mode: process
# Purpose: Multi-page production browsing, idle request timeline, coalescing, selection and cancellation.
# Steps:
#   Start isolated unicd, populate synthetic history, and exercise the production Desktop binding.
# Expected:
#   Idle history stays unchanged; paging and history events preserve browsing context.
# Forbidden:
#   Native UI claims, skipped assertions, missing source/binary hashes or receipt.

acceptance desktopui incremental-browsing
